# FUSE third-party pin: NVIDIA Image Scaling SDK (NVScaler + NVSharpen). Vendored verbatim, no local edits.
# NIS_Scaler.h / NIS_Main.glsl are the GPU shader sources; NIS_Config.h is the host-side constant setup and
# the 64-phase scaler / USM filter coefficient tables. FUSE includes NIS_Config.h from C++ (constants and
# coefficients) and ports NIS_Scaler.h to the CPU single-source kernel in
# Source/FUSE/Renderer/include/fuse/renderer/upscale/nis_kernel.hpp; the fuse_upscale_gpu_reference gate
# compiles NIS_Main.glsl with glslangValidator and runs it on Lavapipe to check the port numerically.
